* The scan loop of the copier ` move2Num ` of TM/Prims.lean: the label moves the whole scanned word from stack ` K ` onto both ` J ` and ` I ` , reversed, one step per letter.  An instantiation of ~ tm2hwrd2 ; the two destinations accumulate the same word, so the accumulating word recursion applies unchanged.

